          "end": 171.07999999999998,
          "en": "of a class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 171.07999999999998,
          "end": 177.17000000000002,
          "en": "But in case of dependency injection you don't have to, uh, create a new a new class or anything.",
