          "id": 45,
          "start": 189.72,
          "end": 194.31,
          "en": "can capture those requests via this request class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 194.31,
          "end": 198.32999999999998,
          "en": "So it will only work with the dependency injection.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 198.32999999999998,
          "end": 203.55,
          "en": "If you use new here new then try to access the request like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 204.21,
          "end": 206.13,
          "en": "Let's say I will put here request.",
          "zh": ""
